@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Створити зоотовар №1 (CAT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pet-supplies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Сухий корм Royal Canin Sterilised для котів",
  "price": 1250.50,
  "petCategory": "CAT",
  "packageWeightKg": 2.00,
  "brand": "Royal Canin"
}

### 2. Створити зоотовар №2 (DOG)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pet-supplies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Корм Brit Premium Adult Large для собак",
  "price": 1890.00,
  "petCategory": "DOG",
  "packageWeightKg": 15.00,
  "brand": "Brit"
}

### 3. Створити зоотовар №3 (BIRD)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pet-supplies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Зернова суміш Versele-Laga Prestige для папуг",
  "price": 245.00,
